## 📋 Project overview

**"AI as an acceleration layer, engineering judgment as the control plane"**

I use AI tools as an engineering acceleration layer, not as the decision-maker. The workflow combines centralized configuration, project-specific directives, MCP context, code review, automated checks, and browser validation so generated work stays bounded by explicit engineering standards.

<ProjectTechStack techStack={metadata.techStack} {locale} />

